      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Laparoscopic sterilizations can be safely performed using room air insufflation. In a series of 400 procedures, the rates of surgical complications were comparable to other laparoscopy studies in which high-pressure gas was used. The purported problems associated with room air insufflation were not encountered in this study."},
